@startuml
title User Service - Authorize a Protected Request

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Client
boundary "Users Router\napp/routes/users.py" as API
control "Authentication\napp/auth.py" as Auth

Client -> API: Protected request + bearer token
activate API
API -> Auth: get_current_session(token)
activate Auth

note right of Auth
  Validate the token, session lifetime,
  and active account status. A valid request
  refreshes only the inactivity deadline.
end note

alt Token or account is not valid
  Auth --> API: Authentication rejected
  API --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
else Session is valid
  Auth --> API: AuthContext
  API --> Client: Protected operation response
else Authentication service unavailable
  Auth --> API: Authentication unavailable
  API --> Client: 503 Service Unavailable
end

deactivate Auth
deactivate API

note over Client,Auth
  Refreshing activity never extends the
  session's 24-hour absolute lifetime.
end note

@enduml
